{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "M03 seat reservations / 个人预约",
    "version": "2.0.0",
    "description": "Asia/Shanghai display; stored timestamptz UTC; [start,end), check-in [start,deadline). Snapshot trusted settings on creation. Source-scoped idempotent durable allocation/release with higher-version tombstones. Account, resource, mail and audit HTTP occurs outside M03 JDBC transactions. Ordinary records owner-only; admin detail independent of aggregate statistics. Production SMTP and complete c+f service integration are separately verified. Lifecycle end guard: administrator cancellation and check-in also require now<endsAt. Reminder creation/retry stops at endsAt; the snapshotted check-in deadline, no-show penalty time and P08 statistics are never shortened to endsAt."
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/reservations/availability": {
      "get": {
        "summary": "Search current available seats; no stale cache fallback",
        "security": [
          {
            "SessionCookie": []
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Success or identical retry"
          },
          "201": {
            "description": "New confirmed reservation"
          },
          "202": {
            "description": "PENDING allocation or CANCEL_PENDING release; not confirmed success"
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Invalid DTO/time/code/cursor"
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Authentication required"
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "Permission/ownership/eligibility denied"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Reservation/resource missing"
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "State/idempotency/version/resource conflict"
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "Necessary dependency unavailable; no fabricated empty or success result"
          }
        },
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "startsAt",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "endsAt",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "date-time"
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "campus",
